cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: CYSTSCAN-PKD
abstract: >
  Automated cyst segmentation and counting in polycystic kidney disease (PKD)
  microCT scans. nnU-Net v2 models segment kidney and cysts; the counting
  algorithm detects cysts via distance-transform peak detection, with six
  parameters optimised by a genetic algorithm against manual counts.
